  "description": "Graphs for the NE.Standard UI framework, three components on one canvas (pan, zoom, groups, a document the viewer edits and saves): NodesComponent, a node editor whose kinds are the application's own attributed classes, with a runner; LayeredGraphComponent, a layered graph over the application's nodes and links; ProductionGraphComponent, resources and recipes with a planner. Platform-independent; the web rendering is NE.Standard.UI.Web.Graph.",
